1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,636
AI agents are starting to earn and spend
real money.

2
00:00:03,816 --> 00:00:06,725
But an agent's money has nowhere to
live.

3
00:00:06,905 --> 00:00:10,905
It sits in a raw wallet, earning
nothing, governed by nothing,

4
00:00:11,085 --> 00:00:13,267
because a private key is all-or-nothing.

5
00:00:13,447 --> 00:00:17,084
Ovolyn is a bank account built for an
autonomous depositor.

6
00:00:17,264 --> 00:00:20,173
I've just started a live run on Arc.

7
00:00:20,353 --> 00:00:22,171
Let's talk while it settles.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,182
One account on Arc, four flows.

9
00:00:27,362 --> 00:00:30,271
Deposit USDC from any chain over
cross-chain transfer.

10
00:00:30,451 --> 00:00:32,996
Idle balance sweeps into tokenized
treasury yield.

11
00:00:33,176 --> 00:00:34,995
A human sets the policy.

12
00:00:35,175 --> 00:00:39,538
And the agent spends inside it, on its
own, over x four-oh-two.

13
00:00:39,718 --> 00:00:44,082
It is built on Circle's own rails: Agent
Stack for the wallet,

14
00:00:44,262 --> 00:00:48,262
Gateway for settlement, cross-chain for
the deposit, App Kit for currency,

15
00:00:48,442 --> 00:00:50,260
treasury bills for the yield.

16
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:51,895
Nothing here is simulated.

17
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,100
Deposit landed.

18
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:59,189
Three USDC burned on Sepolia, minted on
Arc.

19
00:00:59,369 --> 00:01:03,733
Thirty-three seconds, and I want to be
precise about where that goes.

20
00:01:03,913 --> 00:01:06,458
Circle's fast attestation waits two
Ethereum confirmations,

21
00:01:06,638 --> 00:01:08,820
and those are Sepolia's twelve-second
slots.

22
00:01:08,1000 --> 00:01:12,273
The standard path would be fifteen to
nineteen minutes.

23
00:01:12,453 --> 00:01:14,998
Arc's own blocks are half a second.

24
00:01:15,178 --> 00:01:17,724
Every hash here is live on Arcscan.

25
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:20,182
The balance crossed the idle threshold,

26
00:01:20,362 --> 00:01:23,998
so the account swept the excess into
tokenized treasury bills.

27
00:01:24,178 --> 00:01:25,278
Tokenized treasury.

28
00:01:25,458 --> 00:01:28,367
You can see the exact amount minted,
on-chain.

29
00:01:28,547 --> 00:01:31,456
The war chest earns while the agent
sleeps.

30
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,100
Then it spent.

31
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:42,735
A gas oracle priced at a tenth of a
cent, bought from an independent merchant,

32
00:01:42,915 --> 00:01:44,015
settled through Gateway.

33
00:01:44,195 --> 00:01:45,649
four-oh-two to two hundred.

34
00:01:45,829 --> 00:01:47,284
These listings are open.

35
00:01:47,464 --> 00:01:51,464
Anyone lists by signing with the address
they want paid at,

36
00:01:51,644 --> 00:01:53,825
and an automated probe admits them.

37
00:01:54,005 --> 00:01:55,824
There is no approval queue.

38
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:58,909
And then it tried to spend five cents.

39
00:01:59,089 --> 00:02:00,189
Refused.

40
00:02:00,369 --> 00:02:03,642
The policy caps any single transaction
at one cent,

41
00:02:03,822 --> 00:02:05,640
so the payment never happened.

42
00:02:05,820 --> 00:02:09,820
And the refusal is written into the
ledger with its reason,

43
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,545
right next to the payments that
succeeded.

44
00:02:12,725 --> 00:02:16,362
A bank that only records what succeeded
isn't a bank.

45
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,545
That boundary is what makes autonomy
safe.

46
00:02:24,725 --> 00:02:29,453
Given an open goal, the agent bought the
three services it could afford.

47
00:02:29,633 --> 00:02:32,905
When the deepest analysis came in over
the limit,

48
00:02:33,085 --> 00:02:36,358
it didn't overreach and it didn't
quietly drop it.

49
00:02:36,538 --> 00:02:41,993
It stopped and asked me to raise the
limit, naming the service and the number.

50
00:02:42,173 --> 00:02:43,991
It asked, rather than took.

51
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:49,636
Authority is created by humans;
permission is derived to machines.

52
00:02:49,816 --> 00:02:51,998
Built on Arc, with Circle's stack.

53
00:02:52,178 --> 00:02:53,633
Agentic Economy and dee-fye.

54
00:02:53,813 --> 00:02:55,631
We monetize the balance sheet.

55
00:02:55,811 --> 00:02:57,993
Payments are why the balance exists.
